        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The arbitration Committeemen and Chairman shall have no authority to add to, subtract from, change or modify any provisions of this Agreement but shall interpret the existing provisions of this Agreement and apply them to the specific facts of the dispute. The parties shall jointly set forth in writing the specific issues to be arbitrated and the Committee shall confine its award to such issues alone. There shall be no work interruption of any kind pending the decision of the Committee. The expense of the Committee Chairman shall be shared equally by the parties hereto.",
