        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 1. Effective November 10, 1962 to and including January 31, 1964 the Company will contribute to the Amalgamated Food Employees Local 72 Welfare Fund, on behalf of each employee covered by this Agreement who regularly works more than sixty (60) hours per month, the sum of ten cents (10c) per hour for each hour worked, up to a maximum of forty (40) hours each week; effective February 1, 1964 and for the duration of this Agreement the sum of eleven cents (11c) per hour shall be contributed in like manner. For the purpose of this paragraph, paid vacations and paid holidays shall be considered as time worked.",
